# =============================================================================
# sparsa — sparse rejects non-numeric element types in v1.
# =============================================================================
#
# What this teaches:
#   • Element type restriction — sparse tensors require numeric element types in v1
#   • Compile-time guarding — non-numeric declarations are caught before codegen
#
# Common mistakes:
#   • assuming sparse tensors can hold any element type like dense tensors can — sparse requires numeric elements in v1
#
# See also: sparsa, tensor
# =============================================================================


